<ModOps>

  <!-- ================================================================
       REGIONAL FERTILITY SPECIALISTS
       Equip one on an island to give that island every fertility and lode of its region at 100%.
       Scope ObjectsInArea = the island only. AddedFertility holds a single fertility GUID,
       so each item carries one buff per fertility and targets the region's fertility buildings.
       Gracchus Latinus      item 1500050060; buffs 1500050061 to 1500050074; texts 1500059950 to 1500059952
       Gracchus Britannicus  item 1500050080; buffs 1500050081 to 1500050095; texts 1500059953 to 1500059955
       Gracchus Aegyptius    item 1500050100; buffs 1500050101 to 1500050115; texts 1500059956 to 1500059958
       ================================================================ -->

